###1. GET All items
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Accept: application/json

###

###2. GET one item
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/2
Accept: application/json

###

###3. CREATE one item
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Outworld arena",
  "description": "Foraging arena for a small colony"
}

###

###4. Update one item
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "1",
  "name": "Lasius niger colony",
  "description": "Starter colony, brood checked"
}

###

###5. DELETE one item
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items/3
Accept: application/json

###
